---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
---
<section class="intro">
  <p class="lead">Hi, I’m Henrik. This is where I put small projects, old contributions, community work, and things I keep having to explain twice.</p>
  <p>Mostly developer tools, Java, Nix, identity/auth, terminal-shaped stuff, and whatever saved me time recently.</p>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="selected-projects" data-caption="projects">
  <h2 id="selected-projects">Selected projects</h2>
  <ol class="entry-list">
    {% for project in collections.projects %}
      {% if loop.index <= 5 %}
      <li>
        <a href="{{ project.url }}">{{ project.data.title }}</a>
        <time datetime="{{ project.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ project.date | readableDate }}</time>
        {% if project.data.summary %}<p>{{ project.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
      </li>
          {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="recent-contributions" data-caption="contributions">
  <h2 id="recent-contributions">Contributions</h2>
  <ol class="entry-list">
    {% for contribution in collections.contributions %}
      {% if loop.index <= 5 %}
      <li>
        <a href="{{ contribution.url }}">{{ contribution.data.title }}</a>
        <time datetime="{{ contribution.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ contribution.date | readableDate }}</time>
        {% if contribution.data.summary %}<p>{{ contribution.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
      </li>
          {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>
